{{--
    The shop's social row.

    Brand marks are drawn inline rather than pulled from an icon package: the
    build ships blade-heroicons, which is a UI set with no brand glyphs, and
    four paths are not worth a dependency.

    Networks come from the settings table, so a shop that has no TikTok simply
    never renders one — hence the array_filter rather than a fixed list.
--}}
@php
